      <data key="d3">116.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Sorting enables greedy median selection, but incomplete logic caused partial correctness."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sorting ranges is a prerequisite for the greedy assignment strategy in this problem."&lt;SEP&gt;"The problem requires combining sorting and greedy algorithms. The student's incorrect sorting strategy undermines the greedy approach, causing errors."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student combines greedy median selection with sorting to calculate minimal operations, but errors in pairing logic reduce correctness."&lt;SEP&gt;"The greedy approach often leverages sorted data to efficiently find optimal adjustment points, as seen in the student's median-based calculations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sorting enables greedy selection of median values, but the student failed to fully enumerate all possible candidate pairs for optimal transformation."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The student's greedy approach relies on sorted data to compute median values, but incomplete enumeration of possible element pairs caused partial correctness."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The greedy selection of top two frequencies relies on sorted frequency data, but this strategy is flawed as per the error description."&lt;SEP&gt;"The sorted frequency list is used to implement the greedy approach, which is incorrect in certain cases."&lt;SEP&gt;"The greedy approach relies on sorting candidate midpoints to identify the optimal solution."&lt;SEP&gt;"The problem's requirement to count and sort elements aligns with greedy placement strategies."&lt;SEP&gt;"The enumeration of positions and sorting of elements is central to the greedy strategy for matrix transformation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The solution requires a greedy strategy to prioritize placing 1s in the correct quadrant, which the student's enumeration/sorting approach fails to achieve."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student's greedy approach neglects edge cases that could be enumerated for correctness."&lt;SEP&gt;"The greedy strategy requires enumerating characters to ensure uniqueness for the initial segment."</data>
