      <data key="d3">154.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Correct input/output handling is overshadowed by flawed control logic in determining valid cases."&lt;SEP&gt;"Correct input/output handling is used, but the loop structure's error overrides the correct sequential execution."&lt;SEP&gt;"The flawed control structure impacts the overall program flow despite correct input/output handling."&lt;SEP&gt;"The input/output logic is sequentially structured but does not address the core simulation error."&lt;SEP&gt;"The program uses sequential input/output operations within the control structure for data processing."&lt;SEP&gt;"The sequential structure handles input/output while control structures manage conditional logic for matrix construction."&lt;SEP&gt;"The sequential execution of the program is intact, but the conditional logic errors propagate to the final output."&lt;SEP&gt;"Input/output operations rely on control structures for sequential execution, which the student applied correctly."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student's code demonstrates correct control flow and input/output handling, foundational to the implementation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Input/output operations are implemented using control structures like loops and conditionals."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"Input/output operations are sequentially executed within control structures to process test cases."&lt;SEP&gt;"The input/output operations are sequentially structured with control flow for processing test cases."&lt;SEP&gt;"The program's sequential flow includes reading input and writing output, structured via control logic."&lt;SEP&gt;"Input/output operations are integrated with control structures to process the matrix sequentially."&lt;SEP&gt;"The sequential structure relies on control structures for matrix processing, but flawed control logic causes errors in element positioning."&lt;SEP&gt;"Input/output operations are sequentially executed and controlled by loops and conditionals."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sequential execution relies on control structures to handle input validation and output generation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The syntax errors in input parsing disrupt the control flow logic, leading to incomplete program execution."&lt;SEP&gt;"The sequential structure of the code ensures proper order of input processing and swap operations through control structures like loops."&lt;SEP&gt;"The sequential structure handles basic I/O, but the error in conditional logic (control structure) disrupts correct program behavior."</data>
