edy algorithm's implementation uses control structures to build the string, but errors in logic lead to incorrect outputs."&lt;SEP&gt;"The flawed control flow logic prevents the greedy strategy from being applied correctly."&lt;SEP&gt;"Control structures implement the greedy logic for string construction, including conditional checks and iterative assignments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The control structures (loops and conditionals) implement the greedy logic for element movement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The greedy approach requires precise control structures to implement step-by-step movement of elements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The greedy calculation strategy is implemented within the control structure, but errors in the control flow may disrupt the intended greedy logic."</data>
